%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 002b9076b5a919941a76b7b86978d20e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 30_Jian_Arrival
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Conversation
  showPanel: 0
  panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  panelColor: {r: 0.06, g: 0.07, b: 0.13, a: 1}
  panelTitle: 
  Lines:
  - text: The bell rings again. Jian enters, slightly out of breath. He stops when
      he sees Mei and the tin.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There it is. I've been looking everywhere for that tin.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It was in the cupboard where you left it three years ago.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I hoped it would be here.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: By forgetting it existed?
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You must be Jian.
    npcId: 1
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And she told you I lost the recipe.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You said red bean last week.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I said it might have been red bean because I was guessing. I lost the page
      while we were clearing Grandmother's house.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You told me it was somewhere safe.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I was ashamed. By the time I admitted it to myself, I didn't know how to
      admit it to you.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Which was?
    npcId: 1
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: One salted yolk in the centre. Grandmother let me place it there.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Gently, Jian. Set the little moon exactly in the middle.
    npcId: 6
    style: 2
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I was terrified I'd break it. She guided my hands until it sat perfectly
      straight.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: One yolk. A little moon in the middle.
    npcId: 5
    style: 1
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't remember that.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Because you were on the other side of the table, fighting the grinder.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I was not fighting it.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You told a kitchen tool it had insulted your honour.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I was eight.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So was I. Twins, remember?
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mei almost smiles. The tension softens.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mei remembers the lotus and the small spoonful of sugar. Jian remembers
      the yolk. Both of you remember helping at the same table.
    npcId: 1
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And the flowers. Osmanthus. She scattered them over the mold because Mei
      liked the smell.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You remember that too?
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I remember you sneezing into the flour.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Once.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Perhaps the recipe was never kept by one person.
    npcId: 1
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Each carried a different half. Perhaps what remains is enough.
    npcId: 5
    style: 1
    speakerName: 
    hidePortrait: 0
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
